        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pal ciëŋ nhial",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mɛmɛ cua guic, kä nɛnɛ, te ciëŋ nhial kɛ thok mi ɣööŋ! Kä jɔw in jio̱l in cä liŋ ruacɛ kɛ ɣä ce̱tkɛ jɔw kaaŋä, wee i̱, “Bër nhial wanɛ mɛ, kä bä ji̱ nyuɔ̱th ŋɔaani tin bi dhil tuɔɔk kɛ kɔr kä mɛmɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nikä kɛɛl cua ɣä käp ɛ yiëë, kä nɛnɛ, te ciëŋ nhial kɛ kɔm kuäärä mi te ram mi nyuur thi̱n! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɔc ram in nyuur thi̱n ce̱tkɛ guiy ti jaŋ jaaŋ, kä tëëkɛ tik Kuɔth mi buɔy mi ri̱w kɔm kuäärä kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tëëkɛ kɔamni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ ŋuan ti gölkɛ kɔm kuäärä piny, kä nyuur di̱t ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ ŋuan thi̱n, ti ciaŋkɛ bieyni ti bo̱o̱r, kä te wuɔ̱thkiɛn kɛ kuɔ̱mni dääpä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɔm kuäärä ba yiel kɛnɛ wuɔ̱w kɛ ma̱a̱r nhial thi̱n. Kä tëëkɛ rithni da̱ŋ bärɔw ti pɛt nhiam kɔam kuäärä, tin tɔ̱ yiey Kuɔth da̱ŋ bärɔw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä nhiam kɔam kuäärä ɛmɔ tëëkɛ mi ce̱tkɛ bar neenä mi wi̱r wi̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gëëkni kɔam kuäärä tëëkɛ ley da̱ŋ ŋuan ti tëk, ti ci thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ wäŋ nhiam kɛnɛ jɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ley in nhiam in tëk ce̱tdɛ kɛ lony, kä ce̱t ley in rɛwdɛ kɛ thäk, kä diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn ce̱t nhiamdɛ kɛ nhiam ran, kä ŋuaandiɛn ce̱tdɛ kɛ cuɔɔr mi pär nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn ley da̱ŋ ŋuan tin tëk, te mɔ kä kɛ kɛ gɔ̱k da̱ŋ bäkɛl tin thiäŋ kɛ nyin amäni piny gɔ̱ɔ̱kiɛn. Kä /cikɛ kiet päl kɛ cäŋ kɛnɛ wäär, wäkɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ica 6:3.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
